SkillBuilder 4: Search Engine Optimization (SEO) / L'Oréal
Project: SEO Optimized Content

*Note: Obtained Semrush certification for completing the introductory course "Getting Started with Semrush for In-House Marketers" as required for later SEO projects. 

In this hands-on project, you’ll step into the role of a digital marketing associate for CeraVe, a global L'Oréal-owned, mega-popular skincare brand.
You’ll use SEO tools and everything you learned to develop an expanded keyword strategy, and then choose the best keywords and write content for three blog posts designed to educate Carlos, 
reflect CeraVe's brand voice, and attract organic search traffic. Finally, you'll reflect on job interview questions likely to be asked in this transformative AI-era. 
